                "Base zone ID (signed): ${base.zoneId}\nSaved position X/Y (signed): ${base.x}, ${base.y}\nDirection byte: ${base.direction}\nExpansion-status byte: ${base.expansionStatus}\nSaved good count (signed): ${base.goodCount}\n" +
